Hour is coming - I almost conceal it - so that every soul may be recompensed according to that for which it strives.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"20:16","t":"So do not let one avert you from it who does not believe in it and follows his desire, for you [then] would perish.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"20:17","t":"And what is that in your right hand, O Moses?\"","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"20:18","t":"He said, \"It is my staff; I lean upon it, and I bring down leaves for my sheep and I have therein other uses.\"","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"20:19","t":"[Allāh] said, \"Throw it down, O Moses.\"","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"20:20","t":"So he threw it down, and thereupon it was a snake, moving swiftly.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"20:21","t":"[Allāh] said, \"Seize it and fear not; We will return it to its former condition.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"20:22","t":"And draw in your hand to your side; it will come out white without disease - another sign,","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"20:23","t":"That We may show you [some] of Our greater signs.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"20:24","t":"Go to Pharaoh. Indeed, he has transgressed [i.e., tyrannized].\"","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"20:25","t":"[Moses] said, \"My Lord, expand [i.e., relax] for me my breast [with assurance]","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"20:26","t":"And ease for me my task","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"20:27","t":"And untie the knot from my tongue","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"20:28","t":"That they may understand my speech.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"20:29","t":"And appoint for me a minister [i.e., assistant] from my family -","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"20:30","t":"Aaron, my brother.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"20:31","t":"Increase through him my